Date: Tue, 9 Apr 2024 20:00:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 398/913] dts: st: fix timers and lptimers node in stm32mp131

Device tree alignment with Linux kernel, add subnode for timer nodes.
Timer and LP Timer nodes now complies with the yaml dt-bindings.
DTC warnings messages solved:
"... Warning (avoid_unnecessary_addr_size) ... unnecessary ...

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 8e363e20c2b4ccaf7470f5b5df413a57010919d7 dts: st: fix timers and lptimers node in stm32mp131]
